  -- Step 1: Apply det_succ_column_zero to peel off col 0.
  -- Col 0 of M corresponds to σ ⟨0, _⟩ = ⟨2, h_two_lt_pow_dj⟩.
  -- M[i, 0] = unfolding ... ρ_i ⟨2, _⟩, which is hE_i_0.
